  "details": "The sea height in the pop-up preview of Tropical Breeze loading screen seems to be tied to the sea height in the shop preview.\n\n1. Open the Quick Menu.\n\n2. Navigate to Shop.\n\n3. Find the Tropical Breeze loading screen (Beat the Heat promotion).\n\n4. Click \"View Details\".\n\n5. Click and drag the loading screen upwards in this \"View Details\" pop-up to look up, notice the sea is raising with the camera. Look down as well.\n\n6. Press \"X\" in the top right to return to the shop listing.\n\n7. Click and drag the loading screen upwards in the shop.\n\n8. Click \"View Details\".\n\n9. Click and drag the loading screen upwards/downwards in this \"View Details\" pop-up. Notice there's no glitchiness.\n\n10. Press \"X\" in the top right to return to the shop listing.\n\n11. Click and drag the loading screen downwards in the shop.\n\n12. Click \"View Details\".\n\n13. Notice the sea is already glitched and almost always visible, fixed to the top of the camera. You may also drag up/down.\n\nExpected behavior: The sea level should not be fixed to the camera.\n\nActual behavior: The sea level is fixed to the camera.\n\nA video is attached.",
